--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. No third-party dataset is redistributed with this project.

The test fixture (backend/internal/fixture/testdata/*.csv) and the optional
sample warehouse built by scripts/setup-sample-data.sh are generated by
backend/internal/fixture/gen. The data is invented — a fictional retailer, no
real people, no real company, no real transactions — and is covered by this
repository's Apache-2.0 licence like the rest of the source.

An earlier release carried a slice of a third-party public dataset, obtained
through a mirror. No licence permitting redistribution could be established for
it anywhere in that chain, so it was replaced with data we generate rather than
re-hosted under an assumption.

