--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Optional runtime dependencies (not bundled)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Analyst can drive a model through several providers. Two are worth calling out
because they are external programs or services, not libraries, and are governed
by their own terms rather than by this licence:

  Claude Code CLI  — Anthropic's terms of service apply to its use.
  Anthropic API    — Anthropic's terms of service apply to its use.

Neither is required: Analyst ships a deterministic mock provider, so the
product can be run and developed offline with no third-party model service.

(A provider for locally hosted models — Ollama and similar — is planned but
does NOT ship today. The providers in this build are `mock`, `claude-cli` and
`anthropic`.)
